---
// Original StackGeist illustration: which entry-level certification fits which next job.
---
<figure class="sg-illus">
  <div class="sg-illus-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Certification paths illustration">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 860 250" role="img" aria-labelledby="cp-title cp-desc" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <title id="cp-title">Which certification fits which next job</title>
      <desc id="cp-desc">Start from the job you want next. Help desk or desktop support points to CompTIA A+, where CompTIA suggests 12 months of hands-on support work. Networking support points to Network+, where CompTIA suggests A+ plus 9 to 12 months. Cloud support points to AWS Cloud Practitioner, which AWS says needs no IT background. Security+ is usually a later step, with Network+ plus two years suggested.</desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="cp-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#4a3267"/></marker>
      </defs>
      <style>
        .cp-box{fill:#0e0a16;stroke:#3b3846;stroke-width:1.5}
        .cp-hot{fill:rgba(163,230,53,.07);stroke:#a3e635;stroke-width:2}
        .cp-late{fill:#0e0a16;stroke:#c084fc;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:6 5}
        .cp-t{fill:#f7f3fb;font:700 15px ui-sans-serif,system-ui,'Segoe UI',sans-serif}
        .cp-m{fill:#d9d1e0;font:12.5px ui-sans-serif,system-ui,'Segoe UI',sans-serif}
        .cp-k{fill:#c084fc;font:600 11px ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em}
        .cp-ln{stroke:#4a3267;stroke-width:2;fill:none}
      </style>
      <text class="cp-k" x="20" y="24">THE JOB YOU WANT NEXT</text>
      <text class="cp-k" x="330" y="24">START WITH</text>
      <text class="cp-k" x="650" y="24">USUALLY LATER</text>
      <rect class="cp-box" x="10" y="38" width="230" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="cp-t" x="26" y="62">Help desk / desktop</text><text class="cp-m" x="26" y="81">Tickets, hardware, Windows</text>
      <rect class="cp-box" x="10" y="108" width="230" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="cp-t" x="26" y="132">Network support</text><text class="cp-m" x="26" y="151">Switching, IP, troubleshooting</text>
      <rect class="cp-box" x="10" y="178" width="230" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="cp-t" x="26" y="202">Cloud support</text><text class="cp-m" x="26" y="221">AWS accounts and services</text>
      <path class="cp-ln" d="M240 66 H316" marker-end="url(#cp-arrow)"/>
      <path class="cp-ln" d="M240 136 H316" marker-end="url(#cp-arrow)"/>
      <path class="cp-ln" d="M240 206 H316" marker-end="url(#cp-arrow)"/>
      <rect class="cp-hot" x="320" y="38" width="250" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="cp-t" x="336" y="62">CompTIA A+</text><text class="cp-m" x="336" y="81">Two exams · 12 months suggested</text>
      <rect class="cp-box" x="320" y="108" width="250" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="cp-t" x="336" y="132">CompTIA Network+</text><text class="cp-m" x="336" y="151">A+ plus 9–12 months suggested</text>
      <rect class="cp-hot" x="320" y="178" width="250" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="cp-t" x="336" y="202">AWS Cloud Practitioner</text><text class="cp-m" x="336" y="221">No IT background required</text>
      <path class="cp-ln" d="M570 66 C610 66 610 136 646 136" marker-end="url(#cp-arrow)"/>
      <path class="cp-ln" d="M570 136 H646" marker-end="url(#cp-arrow)"/>
      <rect class="cp-late" x="650" y="108" width="200" height="56" rx="8"/><text class="cp-t" x="666" y="132">CompTIA Security+</text><text class="cp-m" x="666" y="151">Network+ plus 2 years suggested</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>The ordering is editorial judgment. Experience figures are the vendors’ suggestions, not requirements, from the official pages linked below. <span class="sg-illus-label">StackGeist illustration</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .sg-illus{margin:32px 0 8px;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--term-border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface)}
  .sg-illus-scroll{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
  .sg-illus svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:640px;height:auto}
  .sg-illus figcaption{margin-top:10px;color:var(--quiet);font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.5}
  .sg-illus-label{margin-left:6px;color:var(--purple-light);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.6875rem;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
</style>
